 eave behind\, and what children discover years later. Siblings Walker and 
 Nan reunite with childhood friend Pip in the downtown loft where their arc
 hitect fathers designed the house that made them famous. A startling will 
 and cryptic journal leave them asking\, who were their parents before they
  became parents?</p>
LOCATION:Longacre Theatre\, 220 West 48th Street\, New York NY 10036
URL:https://www.telecharge.com/three-days-rain-tickets
END:VEVENT
